# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Docs site — environment variables
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#
# The public docs canonical is always https://s3.dimah.dev
# (VERCEL_ENV=production, or a build of the v2 branch).
# v2.s3.dimah.dev redirects there. 1.x docs are https://v1.s3.dimah.dev.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL is ignored on the public deploy so a stale
# dashboard value cannot rewrite canonicals, sitemap, or JSON-LD.
# Set it only for other preview / local tunnel overrides.
#
# Dashboard: Project → Settings → Environment Variables
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL → optional override → https://s3.dimah.dev
#
# Auto-injected by Vercel (do not copy into .env.local):
#   VERCEL_URL
#   VERCEL_ENV                    production | preview | development
#
# Local dev (optional):
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://localhost:3000
